        <div class="qti-layout-col6">
          <div id="itemquestion">
            <p>
              <strong>
                <span>
                  <strong>Maak de tekst kloppend door telkens het juiste woord te kiezen.</strong>
                </span>
              </strong>
            </p>
            <p>In Reno valt gemiddeld <qti-inline-choice-interaction id="I5ef5bf31-ec52-4701-9236-e60f3701b01e" response-identifier="RESPONSE" shuffle="false" required="true"><qti-inline-choice identifier="A"><span>meer</span></qti-inline-choice><qti-inline-choice identifier="B"><span>minder</span></qti-inline-choice></qti-inline-choice-interaction>&#xa0;neerslag dan in Sacramento.</p>
            <p>Dit komt doordat Reno aan de <qti-inline-choice-interaction id="Ia54de253-6386-4644-ad95-eaa0eff161c2" response-identifier="RESPONSE2" shuffle="false" required="true"><qti-inline-choice identifier="A"><span>lijzijde</span></qti-inline-choice><qti-inline-choice identifier="B"><span>loefzijde</span></qti-inline-choice></qti-inline-choice-interaction>&#xa0;van de Sierra Nevada ligt.</p>
            <p>De neerslag die valt in Sacramento is <qti-inline-choice-interaction id="Iab3cf5cf-130a-4a5b-8c6f-6ae051850952" response-identifier="RESPONSE3" shuffle="false" required="true"><qti-inline-choice identifier="A"><span>stijgingsneerslag</span></qti-inline-choice><qti-inline-choice identifier="B"><span>stuwingsneerslag</span></qti-inline-choice></qti-inline-choice-interaction>.</p>
